            "line": 303,
            "text": "theorem axial_lag_primitive_iff\n    (N : ℝ → ℝ) (x Nx Sn : ℝ) (hN : HasDerivAt N Nx x) :\n    HasDerivAt (fun y => y * N y) Sn x ↔ x * Nx + N x = Sn"
